          ],
          "body": "We're seeing signs of recovery for the Microsoft 365 connector. Claude for Outlook is also recovering. Some SharePoint search requests are still returning errors. Microsoft's incident remains open, so errors may return. We're continuing to monitor and will update this post as soon as we have more info.",
          "created_at": "2026-11-13T15:40:53.613Z",
          "custom_tweet": null,
          "deliver_notifications": true,
          "display_at": "2026-11-13T15:40:53.613Z",
